# work/ is an allowlist: everything in it is derived from the game's own files (dialogue text, extracted archives,
# QA transcripts, line sets, prompt dumps) or is local state, EXCEPT the few tables that are entirely ours. Users
# regenerate the rest from their own install: vdfs_extract.py -> parse_ou.py -> npc_gender.py / who_speaks.py -> stages.
work/*
!work/batches/
work/batches/*
!work/batches/*.dir.tsv
work/batches/svm_all.dir.tsv
!work/cast.tsv
!work/cast_features.json
!work/cast_overrides.tsv
!work/gender_llm.tsv
!work/gender_script.tsv
!work/svm_voices.tsv

# generated audio, models, third-party runtime, voice anchors (the anchors ship as a voice bank with the audio pack)
out/
models/
tools/
refs/
*.mod
*.wav

# local one-off experiment drivers and state
run_round3.sh
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.bak-*
*.log
*.err
